  "body": "Changes for v1.6.1\n\n-   Fixed some ancient typos in sqitchtutorial-sqlite, with thanks to @ovid for the report!\n-   Updated ClickHouse logic to always specify \"default\" as the hostname when connecting and the URI includes not hostname. This ensures it doesn't try to use `DSN=sqitch`, which is unlikely to be a configured DSN, and to align with the behavior of the ClickHouse client.\n",
